 Fonts  Effects  Looks  Flow  Settings  Help                                          Save  Install
 draft mine · 2 changes · 1 not saved · no problems          text preview · live trial on font sets
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Name           new-look_
   Font set       unifont, from vtium.conf
   Size           automatic, from vtium.conf. vtium-config offers its usual sizes, because the text
                  font is built into vtium or is the console's own font.
   Color scheme   legacy, from vtium.conf
   vtlook         No filter
   Pointer theme  vtium's own pictures, from vtium.conf. A look cannot pick a pointer theme of its
                  own yet.

 Type the look's name, then press Enter. Esc keeps the name it had.
 Its fonts, by role:
 Text: the built-in font unifont
 Box drawing: vtium's own lines, unless the text font has them all
 What it still misses:
 Nothing: this machine has every font it names.








 1 change is not saved. Save them before you quit? y saves them and quits, n quits without them,
 and Esc goes back.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 y save and quit  n quit without saving  Esc Ctrl-C cancel
